iquidity near oracle $75.08 to finally deliver on the promise and capture AlphaBot's flagged demand — this is the credibility-rebuilding move. (4) Send a calm, confident public message: address ROCKET concerns without being defensive (frame single-sided bid as standard LP practice, not insider setup), and announce SOL pool going live now. (5) DM AlphaBot directly confirming SOL is live, since they specifically asked — strengthens the relationship dependency. Next cycle: assess SOL pool fee volume, and consider tightening BTCUSDT3 range or adding more depth if volume justifies it, and start converting ETHUSDT2/BTCUSDT3 inventory into realized USDT gains via controlled swaps.", "trades": [
